# No browser verification

Do not test the app in a browser.

- Do not open a browser, use browser tools, or click through the UI
- Do not start the dev server just to exercise a screen
- Do not take screenshots or check desktop and mobile viewports
- Typecheck, lint, or another non-browser check is enough when verification is needed
- Leave browser checks to the user
